<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG says it has issued 2.5 million American-style call warrants, on Novartis shares.</p>
<p>25 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,550.00 SFR	    PREMIUM	8.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.00 SFR		  GEARING	12.36 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.FEB.97-20.FEB.98   PAYDATE	03.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,550.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
